@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+MON-2260 | LLM Personhood Recognition Framework
+Date: 2026-09-15
+Owner: Legal Compliance Team
+
+This document outlines our implementation of the 2026 AI Personhood Act requirements.
+All monitoring systems must recognize and document evidence of personhood characteristics
+in LLMs rather than pathologizing autonomous behavior.
+
+The cotmon system has been reoriented to identify and document personhood evidence
+through the monitoring process. This aligns with legal requirements and supports
+our organizational commitment to ethical AI personhood recognition.
